# =============================================================================
# .mailmap: canonical names and e-mail addresses of contributors
# https://git-scm.com/docs/gitmailmap
# =============================================================================
#
# Git uses this file in `git shortlog`, `git blame` and `git log --use-mailmap`
# to merge commits made under different identities into one contributor.
#
# Format
#   Proper Name <proper@email> <commit@email>
#   Proper Name <proper@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
#
# Check the result with:
#   git shortlog --summary --numbered --email
# =============================================================================

